Third-party parts included in public/ keep their own licences:
- Leaflet (map library): BSD 2-Clause, (c) Volodymyr Agafonkin and contributors
- Fonts via Fontsource: Caveat, Libre Baskerville, Oswald, Special Elite, Open Sans, Share Tech Mono, PT Sans, Pixelify Sans,
  VT323, Silkscreen, Fredoka, Nunito, Comic Neue, Gaegu, Press Start 2P,
  Source Sans 3 and Arimo (SIL Open Font License 1.1), and DejaVu Sans (Bitstream Vera / DejaVu font licence)
- The cursors in public/cursors/ are original drawings made for this project, in the spirit of each era
- Map tiles are served by OpenStreetMap: (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL
- heic-to 1.6.6 (iPhone HEIC/HEIF photo decoder, public/vendor/heic-to/): LGPL-3.0, wrapping
  libheif and libde265 (LGPL-3.0). It is a separate, unmodified file that can be swapped for any
  other build; source: https://github.com/hoppergee/heic-to. Licence text in public/vendor/heic-to/LICENSE.
- fflate (zip reader for imports, public/vendor/fflate/): MIT
Libraries bundled into the server: marked (MIT), yaml (ISC), fflate (MIT).
